// Grand Cross (CR_GRANDCROSS): the reference raises thin red ring_red pillars
// on every cell of a cross (four cells each way from the caster plus the
// diagonals) and pulses them three times, 0.5s apart. A billboard can only show
// the arm that crosses the screen, so it is a row of white light pillars, tallest at
// the caster, over a white ground band and core, under a translucent
// cross of light, with sparkles drifting up, three pulses.
// ~1.8s. Pillars are 25 STR px (one cell) apart.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the caster's feet,
// smaller y is higher. Pillars are stretched glow11 rather than the reference
// ring_red: that is a cylinder wrap, and drawn flat its hard top edge shows.
